        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/786187?u=ea03cb781b69bbae33dbd354c0902e37ea57a438&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is the BCD change complementing <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3123673813\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39815\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39815/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39815\">mdn/content#39815</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It adds support data for the Integrity Policy headers.<br>\nIt doesn't yet add it for Safari, as it's only landed in ToT WebKit.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://wpt.fyi/results/subresource-integrity/integrity-policy?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wpt.fyi/results/subresource-integrity/integrity-policy?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27030",
            "title": "Integrity Policy headers",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-10T15:54:24.000Z",
