        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add details of properties added to <code class=\"notranslate\">webNavigation.onCommitted</code> in Chrome in version 74 and 106.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the issue raised in <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39630#top\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39630/hovercard\">webNavigation.onCommitted details does not mention discrepancy with Chromium</a> #39630 by providing clarification that these properties are only supported in Chrome.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27012",
            "title": "webextension.api.webNavigation.onCommitted Chrome only properties",
